<BaseLayout title="About | The Royal House of Engagement" description="Low Value Content makes wearable observations about the systems, rituals, and small humiliations of online life.">
  <article class="plain-page ivory">
    <p class="script">A Brief Chronicle</p>
    <h1>The observation is immediate. The garment is enduring.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Low Value Content records the systems, rituals, and routine indignities of online life. It serves as purveyor and public threshold to the Royal House of Engagement, the House charged with keeping order over the realm's attention.</p>
    <div class="columns"><section><h2>The subject</h2><p>The work concerns the powers and customs of the online realm: platforms, courts, metrics, markets, and the conduct they produce. Individuals and communities are not the object of examination.</p></section><section><h2>The standard</h2><p>Every design must stand as a complete garment before extended provenance is considered. One print, on the front: the shirt says one thing.</p></section><section><h2>The issue</h2><p>Low Value Content is an imprint of Nelson Grey LLC. The founding collection is six shirts, printed to order and shipped within the United States. Sizes, colors, and prices are as listed; see Shipping and Returns for the terms.</p></section></div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
